cker has raised $1.2 million with under $400,000 available. Analysts across the spectrum rate the seat Likely or Safe Democratic, and prediction markets price Riley's chances at 95 to 97 percent. Utility costs have emerged as a local flashpoint, but with no public polls and limited Republican investment, Riley enters November as a clear favorite.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9635, "margin": 11.98}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9741, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9566, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9622, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9504, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9482, "margin": 12.0}]}